---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="AUS Immigration Detention Reforms — Advocacy — IICC Mission" description="IICC Mission advocates for humane, just and transparent reform of Australia's immigration detention system.">

  <div style="background:var(--color-off-white);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(27,39,81,0.07);">
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a><span class="breadcrumb__sep">›</span>
        <a href="/advocacy">Advocacy</a><span class="breadcrumb__sep">›</span>
        <span class="breadcrumb__current">AUS Immigration Detention Reforms</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-full" style="min-height:54vh;">
    <div class="hero-full__bg">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529156069898-49953e39b3ac?w=1400&h=700&fit=crop" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
    </div>
    <div class="hero-full__overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-full__content">
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--white" style="display:block;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Advocacy for Change</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem);font-weight:900;color:#fff;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
        AUS IMMIGRATION<br>DETENTION REFORMS
      </h1>
      <span class="rule rule--amber" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;display:block;"></span>
      <p style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:clamp(1rem,2.5vw,1.25rem);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);max-width:520px;line-height:1.6;">"Speak up for those who cannot speak for themselves." — Proverbs 31:8</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cols-2" style="gap:3rem;align-items:start;">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow" style="display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">The Problem</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Australia's Detention System Needs Reform</h2>
          <span class="rule rule--amber" style="display:block;margin-bottom:1.25rem;"></span>
          <span class="heart" style="display:block;margin-bottom:1rem;">♥</span>
          <p class="section-desc" style="max-width:none;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            Australia's immigration detention system holds thousands of people — many for extended periods without trial, without charge and without a clear pathway to resolution. These include asylum seekers, refugees and individuals with no criminal history.
          </p>
          <p class="section-desc" style="max-width:none;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            IICC Mission has witnessed first-hand the devastating impact of prolonged detention on the mental, physical and spiritual wellbeing of detainees and their families. We cannot stay silent.
          </p>
          <p class="section-desc" style="max-width:none;">
            We call on the Australian government and all people of goodwill to advocate for a more just, humane and transparent system that upholds the dignity of every person.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow" style="display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Our Reforms Agenda</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What We Are Calling For</h2>
          <span class="rule rule--amber" style="display:block;margin-bottom:1.25rem;"></span>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Time limits on immigration detention — no indefinite detention</li>
            <li>Independent oversight and accountability mechanisms</li>
            <li>Access to fair and timely legal processes for all detainees</li>
            <li>Community-based alternatives to detention where appropriate</li>
            <li>Adequate mental health services for those held in detention</li>
            <li>Humane physical conditions and respect for religious practice</li>
            <li>Transparent reporting on the number and duration of detentions</li>
            <li>Special protections for vulnerable groups including children</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--navy">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--white">Take Action</span>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem);letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff;">HOW YOU CAN HELP</h2>
        <span class="rule rule--amber rule--center"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-4">
        {[
          { icon: '✍️', title: 'Sign Petitions', desc: 'Add your voice to petitions calling for detention reform in Australia.' },
          { icon: '📢', title: 'Write to MPs', desc: 'Contact your local Member of Parliament and call for humane immigration reform.' },
          { icon: '🌐', title: 'Share Our Stories', desc: 'Share our advocacy content and raise awareness in your networks.' },
          { icon: '🙏', title: 'Pray', desc: 'Intercede for detainees, their families and for the hearts of policymakers.' },
        ].map(c => (
          <div class="card--dark" style="align-items:center;text-align:center;">
            <div class="card__icon" style="font-size:1.125rem;border-color:rgba(224,123,0,0.4);">{c.icon}</div>
            <p class="card__title">{c.title}</p>
            <p class="card__body">{c.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="amber-band">
    <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
      <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1rem,2.5vw,1.375rem);font-weight:900;color:#fff;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">JOIN THE ADVOCACY MOVEMENT</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn" style="background:#fff;color:var(--color-amber);font-weight:800;margin-top:0.5rem;">GET INVOLVED ›</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
